k their dividends with some of the deepest free cash flow in the entire market. These three names may change how you think about income investing inside a growth index.", "url": "https://247wallst.com/investing/2026/09/26/3-elite-dividend-stocks-hiding-in-the-nasdaq-100/?.tsrc=rss", "source": "Yahoo! Finance: MSFT News", "published_at": "2026-09-26T15:58:22Z", "symbols": ["MSFT"], "sentiment": 0.8338, "sentiment_label": "positive", "provider": "rss"}, {"id": "85c4515b705143d2", "title": "Big Tech's AI build-out ran to the Middle East. Then the Iran war hit.", "summary": "The Iran war has forced Big Tech to confront physical security in ways it never has before.", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/article/big-techs-ai-build-out-ran-to-the-middle-east-then-the-iran-war-hit-114102296.html?.tsrc=rss", "source": "Yahoo! Finance: MSFT News", "published_at": "2026-09-26T11:41:02Z", "symbols": ["MSFT"], "sentiment": -0.8779, "sentiment_label": "negative", "provider": "rss"}, {"id": "6cb4b8b1189ffda3", "title": "Microsoft Copilot Is Turning Into An \u2018AI Operating System\u2019 \u2014 Here\u2019s What It Means For MSFT Stock, According To Oppenheimer\u2019s Brian Schwartz", "summary": "During an interview with CNBC, Schwartz said Microsoft\u2019s Copilot announcement changes the narrative around the company as investors continue to search for clear winners in the AI era.", "url": "https://stocktwits.com/news-articles/markets/equity/msft-copilot-operating-system-higher-engagement-monetization-oppenheinmer/cZMgQ8IRBOw?.tsrc=rss", "source": "Yahoo! Finance: MSFT News", "published_at": "2026-09-26T10:59:10Z", "symbols": ["MSFT"], "sentiment": 0.6908, "sentiment_label": "positive", "provider": "rss"}, {"id": "820167eb0f09de0b", "title": "How Investors May Respond To Toho (TSE:9602) Raising Its Interim Dividend To \u00a511 Per Share", "summary": "In September 2026, Toho Co., Ltd. resolved at a Board meeting to pay an interim dividend from surplus of \u00a511 per share fo