:04Z", "symbols": ["MSFT"], "sentiment": 0.6486, "sentiment_label": "positive", "provider": "rss"}, {"id": "62f649f34413719f", "title": "Azure\u2019s Inflection Point: Can Microsoft (MSFT) Balance AI Growth With Capex Risk?", "summary": "Microsoft Corporation (NASDAQ:MSFT) has lagged the broader market amid growing concerns about ballooning capital expenditure. The stock is up roughly 5% year to date, compared with a gain of about 21% for the tech-heavy Nasdaq 100, which has bounced to record levels. Investors have also been weighing Microsoft\u2019s capital allocation strategy, particularly after its latest [\u2026]", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/ai/articles/azure-inflection-point-microsoft-msft-231347500.html?.tsrc=rss", "source": "Yahoo! Finance: MSFT News", "published_at": "2026-09-25T23:13:47Z", "symbols": ["MSFT"], "sentiment": 0.5267, "sentiment_label": "positive", "provider": "rss"}, {"id": "bd9e9c43fa96c82d", "title": "What Is Microsoft (MSFT) Planning With Its $10 Billion Gulf Cloud And AI Push?", "summary": "Microsoft (NasdaqGS:MSFT) plans to invest over US$10b in cloud and AI infrastructure across Gulf countries by 2030. The program targets new subsea and terrestrial connectivity plus data center capacity aimed at regional digital resilience. Management is partnering with Middle Eastern AI organizations to build local capabilities on top of Microsoft's cloud platforms. This large Gulf cloud and AI build out is only one piece of what is changing around Microsoft today. Take a look at 1 warning...", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/ai/articles/microsoft-msft-planning-10-billion-230941852.html?.tsrc=rss", "source": "Yahoo! Finance: MSFT News", "published_at": "2026-09-25T23:09:41Z", "symbols": ["MSFT"], "sentiment": -0.1531, "sentiment_label": "negative", "provider": "rss"}, {"id": "1900dac81b8ec348", "title": "S&P 500, Dow, Nasdaq End Week Higher On Chipmaker Strength, Easing Oil Amid Signs Of Easing US-Iran Conflict \u2014 META, COST, MSFT, CRWD, SKHY In Focus", "summary": "Iran pitched a seven-day roadmap to end conflict with the U.S., the New York Times reported.", "url": "https://stocktwits.com/news-articles/markets/equity/s-and-p-500-dow-nasdaq-end-week-higher-on-chipmaker-strength-easing-oil-amid-signs-of-easing-us-iran-conflict-meta-cost-msft-crwd-skhy-in-focus/cZMOFkXRBOV?.tsrc=rss", "source": "Yahoo! Finance: MSFT News", "published_at": "2026-09-25T22:51:48Z", "symbols": ["MSFT"], "sentiment": 0.3818, "sentiment_label": "positive", "provider": "rss"}, {"id": "8b65944d7cc742df", "title": "Goldman Sachs Outweighs Microsoft in This Popular Dow ETF, and Share Price Is the Only Reason", "summary": "One number buried inside a popular Dow ETF quietly hands a smaller company more of your retirement dollars than a corporate giant worth more than ten times as much, and the reason has nothing to do with performance, profit, or business fundamentals.", "url": "https://247wallst.com/investing/etf/2026/09/25/goldman-sachs-outweighs-microsoft-in-this-popular-dow-etf-and-share-price-is-the-only-reason/?.tsrc=rss", "source": "Yahoo! Finance: MSFT News", "published_at": "2026-09-25T22:00:10Z", "symbols": ["MSFT"], "sentiment": 0.9072, "sentiment_label": "positive", "provider": "rss"}, {"id": "62b288e6668fc878", "title": "Microsoft, IBD Stock Of The Day, Makes Bullish Move As Software Giant Launches AI Super-App", "summary": "Microsoft rose Friday after the announcing a revamped version of its Copilot artificial intelligence tool.", "url": "https://in.finance.yahoo.com/m/de2c612d-25a8-31db-b651-98f4c0528eb0/microsoft%2C-ibd-stock-of-the.html?.tsrc=rss", "source": "Yahoo! Finance: MSFT News", "published_at": "2026-09-25T21:04:48Z", "symbols": ["MSFT"], "sentiment": 0.4767, "sentiment_label": "positive", "provider": "rss"}, {"id": "d9416d344bf9a273", "title": "Wall Street ends higher as investors buy AI stocks; Microsoft rallies", "summary": "By Noel Randewich and Johann M Cherian Sept 25 (Reuters) - Wall Street ended higher on Friday, lifted by Microsoft and other AI-related technology stocks, while high oil prices and a recent surge in", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/wall-st-futures-gain-ai-095035646.html?.tsrc=rss", "source": "Yahoo! Finance: MSFT News", "published_at": "2026-09-25T20:19:07Z", "symbols": ["MSFT"], "sentiment": 0.0, "sentiment_label": "neutral", "provider": "rss"}, {"id": "45bf7ef2f9c83e4e", "title": "Dow ends 400 points higher as investors buy AI stocks; Microsoft rallies", "summary": "Wall Street experienced gains on Friday, driven by positive performance from Microsoft and AI-related technology stocks. High oil prices and rising US Treasury yields created investor uncertainty throughout the week. Various industries are under scrutiny regarding their prospects related to artificial intelligence advancements. Additionally, traders faced a potential interest rate increase by the Federal Reserve in October.", "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/us-stocks/wall-street-guide/dow-ends-400-points-higher-as-investors-buy-ai-stocks-microsoft-rallies/articleshow/134492147.cms", "source": "Markets-Economic Times", "published_at": "2026-09-25T20:11:14Z", "symbols": ["MSFT"], "sentiment": 0.9432, "sentiment_label": "positive", "provider": "rss"}, {"id": "1f9db7f569f8bfb4", "title": "What's different about Microsoft's Copilot AI reboot", "summary": "Microsoft (MSFT) launched a reboot of Copilot, shifting its focus from personal AI to workplace use. Yahoo Finance Technology Editor Dan Howley explains what you should know.", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/video/whats-different-microsofts-copilot-ai-195423063.html?.tsrc=rss", "source": "Yahoo! Finance: MSFT News", "published_at": "2026-09-25T19:54:23Z", "symbols": ["MSFT"], "sentiment": 0.128, "sentiment_label": "positive", "provider": "rss"}, {"id": "3ace5ecfd9d82b03", "title": "Microsoft Stock Is on Pace for Its Highest Close in Nearly 11 Months. Here\u2019s Why.", "summary": "Shares of Microsoft rose Friday and were on pace for their highest closing price in nearly 11 months after the company introduced new capabilities for its artificial-intelligence assistant tool. Microsoft stock advanced 4.2% to $518.84 on Friday and was on pace for its highest closing price since Oct. 30, according to Dow Jones Market Data. Microsoft in a blog post Friday introduced new capabilities for Copilot, its AI assistant, that will connect different tools to build, customize, and scale AI across work flows.", "url": "https://in.finance.yahoo.com/m/946896e0-f1fb-3adf-a31d-522897866e3a/microsoft-stock-is-on-pace.html?.tsrc=rss", "source": "Yahoo! Finance: MSFT News", "published_at": "2026-09-25T18:43:00Z", "symbols": ["MSFT"], "sentiment": 0.4939, "sentiment_label": "positive", "provider": "rss"}, {"id": "047c5710e7c84fe1", "title": "Top Bank Tweaks Microsoft Stock Price Target for 2027", "summary": "Microsoft Stock Gets Surprise Upgrade as Stifel Sees Growth Back on Track", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/top-bank-tweaks-microsoft-stock-183747713.html?.tsrc=rss", "source": "Yahoo! Finance: MSFT News", "published_at": "2026-09-25T18:37:47Z", "symbols": ["MSFT"], "sentiment": 0.6705, "sentiment_label": "positive", "provider": "rss"}, {"id": "1184e9f2f80b90c6", "title": "US stocks trade higher as AI enthusiasm eases worries over higher oil prices, yields", "summary": "Wall Street experienced gains driven by optimism in artificial intelligence despite high oil prices and rising Treasury yields. Microsoft shares increased significantly after the launch of new AI capabilities in the Copilot app. Negotiations to address the Middle East conflict positively influenced market sentiment among investors. However, concerns about inflation and prolonged geopolitical issues limited market enthusiasm.", "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/us-stocks/wall-street-guide/us-stocks-open-higher-as-ai-enthusiasm-eases-worries-over-higher-oil-prices-yields/articleshow/134486867.cms", "source": "Markets-Economic Times", "published_at": "2026-09-25T13:38:24Z", "symbols": ["MSFT"], "sentiment": 0.9559, "sentiment_label": "positive", "provider": "rss"}, {"id": "b66ed307d282235f", "title": "Big AI reset ahead? Chris Wood doubts hyperscalers\u2019 $990 bn capex estimates, highlights India\u2019s reverse AI trade advantage", "summary": "Jefferies\u2019 Chris Wood expects the AI investment narrative to face a major reset, questioning whether Meta, Alphabet, Amazon and Microsoft can sustain $990 billion in projected 2027 capex. He also sees Indian IT services as a potential reverse AI trade, with valuations falling even as employment remains resilient.", "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/big-ai-reset-ahead-chris-wood-doubts-hyperscalers-990-bn-capex-estimates-highlights-indias-reverse-ai-trade-advantage/articleshow/134478611.cms", "source": "Stocks-Markets-Economic Times", "published_at": "2026-09-25T07:31:00Z", "symbols": ["MSFT"], "sentiment": -0.197, "sentiment_label": "negative", "provider": "rss"}]}, "filings": {"ok": true, "provider": null, "data": {"cik": "MSFT", "company_name": "", "symbol": null, "filings": [{"accession": "0000789019-26-000224", "cik": "0000789019", "company_name": "MICROSOFT CORP", "symbol": null, "form_type": "4", "filed_date": "2026-09-17", "period_of_report": "2026-09-15", "edgar_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/789019/000078901926000224/"}, {"accession": "0000789019-26-000223", "cik": "0000789019", "company_name": "MICROSOFT CORP", "symbol": null, "form_type": "4", "filed_date": "2026-09-17", "period_of_report": "2026-09-15", "edgar_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/789019/000078901926000223/"}, {"accession": "0000789019-26-000222", "cik": "0000789019", "company_name": "MICROSOFT CORP", "symbol": null, "form_type": "4", "filed_date": "2026-09-17", "period_of_report": "2026-09-15", "edgar_url": "https://www